a5=A.F("What defines their relationship is a sense of partnership \u2014 the certainty that no matter what life brings, they can face it together. \u201cWhen one of us is having a bad day, the other one\u2019s probably picking up some of the slack. We\u2019re looking after each other because it\u2019s us against everything, as opposed to us against each other,\u201d "+f+" says.",b1,b1,b1,B.bC,b1,b1)
